---
import "../styles/national-travel-subsidy.css";

interface Props {
  id?: string;
  variant?: "lovetour" | "starrywhale";
  class?: string;
}

const {
  id = "national-travel-subsidy",
  variant = "lovetour",
  class: className = "",
} = Astro.props;
---

<section
  id={id}
  class:list={[
    "national-subsidy-info",
    `national-subsidy-info--${variant}`,
    className,
  ]}
  aria-labelledby={`${id}-title`}
>
  <div class="national-subsidy-info__inner">
    <div class="national-subsidy-info__heading">
      <p class="national-subsidy-info__eyebrow">平日住宿獎助活動</p>
      <h2 id={`${id}-title`}>國旅補助說明</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="national-subsidy-info__content">
      <p>本館參與 2026 平日住宿獎助活動，符合資格旅客可於活動期間依規定使用住宿折抵。</p>
      <ul>
        <li>適用期間：9/1–11/30，週日–週四適用（不含國定假日及其連續假期）。</li>
        <li>澎湖離島連續住宿兩晚合計最高折抵 $2,500，實際折抵依活動規定、旅客資格及剩餘補助額度為準。</li>
        <li>入住前請先完成登錄；完成登錄不代表保證取得折抵，入住時請依規定提供本人證件供旅宿核對。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
